This product includes software developed by the Termux project
(https://github.com/termux/termux-app): the terminal-emulator and
terminal-view modules, licensed under the Apache License 2.0, which are
derived from Jack Palevich's Android-Terminal-Emulator. ASL modifies
TerminalSession to run over a VM connection instead of a local pty and
makes TerminalView subclassable.

app/src/main/assets/keyboard/thai_kedmanee.kcm is the Thai Kedmanee keyboard
layout from the Android Open Source Project (frameworks/base InputDevices),
Copyright 2024 The Android Open Source Project, Apache License 2.0.

At build time the guest image includes third-party software, each under its
own license: the Linux kernel (GPL-2.0), BusyBox (GPL-2.0), e2fsprogs, tar,
xz, zstd and gzip from Alpine Linux, plus the Go modules golang.org/x/sys and
github.com/creack/pty (BSD-3-Clause / MIT).
